<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName},</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">The Transfer Achievement Award is for eligible residents; however, it is based upon <b>both</b>&nbsp;high academic achievement (3.5+ cumulative GPA) and financial need. Typically, a good indicator of financial need is if you are eligible to receive the Pell Grant, which would automatically be listed with your financial aid awards on your <a href="http://www.google.com/url?q=http%3A%2F%2Fmy.asu.edu&amp;sa=D&amp;sntz=1&amp;usg=AFQjCNEgLI1T20MQ7HMdoTLQy6mthStfLw">My ASU</a> account once you are admitted to ASU and your FAFSA has been reviewed.&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">ASU is recognized as a top school in the nation for value so you can feel confident in knowing that the investment you are making in your education will <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fasunews.asu.edu%2F20130618_AffordabilityRanking&amp;sa=D&amp;sntz=1&amp;usg=AFQjCNFn3kSJZ2QSr6QXzOcNcusvKkecVg">pay off</a>. Still, I understand that university tuition can be intimidating. I encourage you to explore additional scholarships that are offered to transfer students -- see the links below:</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fscholarships.asu.edu%2Ftransfers&amp;sa=D&amp;sntz=1&amp;usg=AFQjCNEho0vHj2vzX7gMzJH8OWmcvPGPPg">scholarships.asu.edu/transfers</a></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fscholarships.asu.edu%2Fcolleges&amp;sa=D&amp;sntz=1&amp;usg=AFQjCNH-tI06zL5v_xo3AAQ3nIRZnu-8UA">scholarships.asu.edu/colleges</a></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><a href="https://students.asu.edu/scholarships/resources">students.asu.edu/scholarships/resources</a></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">You may also be interested in searching for student jobs: <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fstudents.asu.edu%2Ffinancialaid%2Fjobs&amp;sa=D&amp;sntz=1&amp;usg=AFQjCNFE6Lf65k7g_3xIRaa3wCB6wDR-5w">students.asu.edu/financialaid/jobs</a></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Please feel free to contact me if you have additional questions. I am happy to help.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial;">Admission Services</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial;">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div></div></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>